<h1>Monk</h1>
<p>
  This page is ERB, compiled to a method at boot and rendered inside
  whichever worker Ractor served the request. The clock below is vanilla
  JavaScript loaded as an ES module through an import map.
</p>

<p class="clock" id="clock">--:--:--</p>

<h2>Routes in this demo</h2>
<ul class="routes">
  <% locals[:routes].each do |path, description| -%>
    <%= render "route", path: path, description: description -%>
  <% end -%>
</ul>
